# deps/ara is a separately managed checkout with its own .git; don't let
# it get swept in as a stray embedded repo by a broad `git add`.
deps/ara/

# cva6_patched is hand-vendored (not a Bender checkout), tracked here so it
# can't be silently wiped again like it was during the 2026-08-21 merge
# incident -- but only the RTL actually used by the zcu102 build
# (target/xilinx/scripts/add_sources.zcu102.tcl). Everything below is
# vendored verification/doc infra with its own nested .git repos, or
# otherwise unneeded for synthesis -- tracking it risks the multi-GB
# bloat this directory was originally excluded from git to avoid.
cva6_patched/verif/
cva6_patched/corev_apu/
cva6_patched/docs/
cva6_patched/core/cvfpu/
cva6_patched/core/cache_subsystem/hpdcache/
cva6_patched/**/*.bak*
